  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=237",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『倍轻松』颈部按摩仪</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机联动功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">倍轻松颈部按摩仪通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现对颈部按摩仪传统艾灸、艾灸碳、光疗、大师模式、放松模式、开肩模式等功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/fba83a68cd714bba92873e5227e21154.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-954c742c9b4846c3b893508d7f269899-0-2c61a2de9d2a1cda5d9c29bec78e346cddf08e8ab7eaf8d11fc0e2637aed269e\" alt=\"车机大屏操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 421.00px;height: 689.50px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 颈部按摩仪车机联动</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.1 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">模式支持“开肩”、“混合”、“热灸”三种模式切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">手法替换支持“混合”、“拔筋”、“活力”、“硬核”；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压支持“低挡”、“中挡”、“高挡”三挡调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">热敷支持“关闭”、“低挡”、“高挡”三档调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">定时设置支持多种时间段；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/836cfbfd35fd41e5afc60d30ac1318f5.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-53abca3c3b0e4165ade2e9ae4b8874f4-0-f6212f9674d9bf7d2135d0f408c040c96dfac24ed424739fcb85c568d619725d\" alt=\"设备-243-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑2-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ec5d5cf3bbad41c4ad57392c10dd89ac.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-ca659b3ab1e1428899c94a9428993558-0-555e702a6ac63c0d4303bcde78e13fba55fc93d2ff2fddf7acb6dac7c2854072\" alt=\"设备-244-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 722.00px;height: 406.13px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/352287f2f98a4ac783a7a4e91f63e70b.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-8b8727f4191f40a29c341f71c23ed33e-0-01595bc3e43d43620e92d00988424d4f54531e4741aa5a33fc045f4fbd34bc90\" alt=\"设备-246-首页-颈部按摩仪(1)-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 718.00px;height: 403.84px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-4 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制3</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 车机语音功能</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音实现了车机大屏控制颈部按摩仪的全部功能。方便用户解放双手，畅享按摩。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端语音控制说明提供了操控该设备的语控提示词，如</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e047e01a88544d93bf9d5fb6d94efd9b.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-f684b57368ba4cdb89cffe69555967ce-0-00586965bb117d7264c8df38afbf3f1184ce534451aaf508cc47c5ae230c8a79\" alt=\"语控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 436.00px;height: 694.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-5 颈部按摩仪车机语控</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e227404f6b7645e69121ed1b83719bc9.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-d09ec261bb79407a9c06693f888714b7-0-d58e4940ff75e45a37d27c1ad1cb0e5bddf47517ec656f36d4b981a8264955e8\" alt=\"设备-100-首页-颈部按摩仪-语音控制说明-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6 颈部按摩仪车机语控说明</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 手机控制功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">颈部按摩仪离开车机的使用场景中，手机也可控制按摩仪的功能。从手机端比亚迪App的\"我的-&gt;智慧物联\"，添加颈部按摩仪，进入按摩仪的控制界面，该界面可显示并控制颈部按摩仪剩余电量、热敷模块状态、按压调节和剩余时间、当前模式等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7f389406c3bd46af92133d800e7f2203.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-39fbeead4aca47dcbe769fdb948ded48-0-0d00dc99f1023066e16f839652aab5845e017eef2906319e6e5728b6179be1e7\" alt=\"手机操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 725.89px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9fde5bd04415436a8eb5abd34b844fa3.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-75f2c486f043498eb3ca5c7039882bc8-0-1597e66ec4307996a9a0dbb6ec91002e4f536fb3c09ab688dabf73ce3b1e0ec9\" alt=\"缩小比例.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a6271d7d5d9046eda6daa0f1c2f84671.jpg?auth_key=1795675072-129ea3a2c5d54435aad31fe7a7ab0048-0-2a1e5e69f9e22153169550c3f1f8c1cfa465c9308aa1150927dd74ffdcd7070a\" alt=\"缩小2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 手机端操控颈部按摩仪</span></p>"
}
